# Cross-language IR divergence between the python and typescript accepted corpora.
#
# GENERATED. Regenerate from a real run with:
#   UPDATE_DIVERGENCE=1 cargo test -p compylr-registry --test divergence
#
# A member is listed when BOTH corpora define it, under the same name. The check
# recomputes rather than trusting this file, and requires it to match exactly: a
# score that rises fails, a score that falls fails until it is recorded, and a
# value edited by hand fails. The only way the numbers move is a real run.
#
# total 0
# pairs 14

